  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "IVAR 伊娃 储物单元采用实木制成，有无数种组合方式，可以漆成任何你喜欢的颜色。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50214999",
    "90340383",
    "s89149880"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/49/f8/49f815785c13c1cf62c196d890d2965c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
